NOTE ON UNDERLYING SOURCE DOCUMENTS

The PDFs catalogued in this dataset originate from public regulatory filings
submitted to the Maryland Insurance Administration via the SERFF public
access portal. Inclusion of those PDFs in any redistributed bundle is gated
on a separate review of the SERFF terms of use; absent that, this dataset
ships metadata and acquisition scripts only. The CC BY 4.0 license applies
to the metadata, fingerprints, documentation, and any aggregate findings
produced by the project, regardless of whether the underlying PDFs are
included.
